{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55214","headline":"问香岩和尚（题拟） · 郑郎中","name":"问香岩和尚（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来无他[辙]（彻）迹，去是非我途。\n并逐猿猴尽，山川境在无？\n（见《祖堂集》卷十九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑郎中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}